window.products.push({"id":74015,"name":"Ice Maker Countertop, 3 in 1 Ice Machine with Water Cooler Dispenser, Portable Ice Maker, 44lbs / Day Ice Cube Maker for Home, Kitchen, Restaurant and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iE9wC6O4L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ice Making】: The water cooler can make 12 ice cubes at a time in 7-14mins ( depends on temperature). The ice basket holds up to 4lbs, but it has no insulation, please take out the ice once made. It is able to make up to 44lbs of ice per day. 【Water Dispenser & Ice Maker】：The water dispenser with ice maker countertop can produce ice, hot and cold water for whenever or wherever you need it. Besides, our water dispenser is ETL Approved, ensuring your safety on the quality and use of the machine. 【Stainless Steel Liner】: The stainless steel liner can keep the water clean and hygienic. At the same time, the cooling and heating efficiency is really high, reducing energy consumption. In addition, it is particularly corrosion-resistant and has a long performance life. 【Top-loading Water Dispenser】: Besides adding water directly ( up to 0.8gal ), you can also use gallon jug. The top-loading design can not only clearly see whether there is water, but also prevent dirt from entering the water, ensuring the cleanliness of drinking water. It is suitable for 3-5 gallon water bottles and measures 18.5''*12.83''*20.83'', perferct for home, kitchen, restaurant and office. 【Easy to Use】: Our water dispenser features an easy operate panel with touch buttons: indicators with light give you clear instruct to operate this machine. There is a product instruction manual in the package, which can ensure your convenient use. 【Satisfactory Service】: As your satisfaction is of the utmost importance to us, Joy Pebble is committed to providing you with premium products and thoughtful service. Please do not hesitate to contact us if you have any questions about our products. We will do our best to resolve the issues as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iE9wC6O4L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joy Pebble","source_asin":"B0C23RY91C","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74015","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C23RY91C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C23RY91C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
