window.products.push({"id":74102,"name":"BANGSON Portable Washing Machine, 17.6 lbs Washer(11Lbs) and Spinner(6.6Lbs), Mini Compact Twin Tub Washing Machine, Washer and Dryer Combo, Timer Con","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":131.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wshn46HmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💧[Compact and Portable]: BANGSON Portable Washing Machine, Total capacity is 17.6 lbs, portable washer 11 lbs and spin dryer 6.6 lbs. You can wash about 15-20 shirts, or 5-6 jeans, or 2-4 jackets in once laundry. Lightweight and space-saving design allows it easily fit in dorms, apartments, home, RV’s, camping trips or anywhere with limited space. Note: There could be water in the machine because of the testing procedure. We DO NOT sell used products! 💧[Power Cleanning]: The BANGSON washing machine features a 1700 rpm motor. The high-speed water spinning can clean the dirt effectively. The filter in the washer can be removed and cleaned easily, which makes the self-maintanance easy, and keeps the tub free of dirts accumulation. 💧[Easy Operation]: You can easily operate the clothes BANGSON washing machine with 3 wash modes(Soft/Normal/Drain). Wash timer for 15 mins and Spin timer for 5 minutes. Except for normal washing, it is also equipped with the newest 20 minute soaking function, offering your clothes a deeper cleaning and less process. 💧[Upgrade Design]: The BANGSON Washing machine with extended power cord(78.7''), inlet pipe(59'') and drain pipe (32''), the new model offers you more flexiblity with installment. It also has a clamp that can help the inlet pipe fit with different faucet. 💙[After-Sale Service ]: Inner tubs of BANGSON Washing Machine are made of PP plastic, you can feel free to use it for baby clothes washing. Note: The spin dryer cannot completely dry the clothes, you still need to dry it or use a dryer. Contact the after-sales team anytime if you have any problems, we will respond within 24 hours.The washing machine is a great Christmas gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wshn46HmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BANGSON","source_asin":"B09K7S53MV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09K7S53MV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09K7S53MV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
