window.products.push({"id":74171,"name":"SimpleReal - Pour Over Coffee Kettle with Thermometer, Gooseneck Single Serve Mini Kettle for Coffee and Tea, TAMAGO Japanese Style, Stainless Steel b","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iHWinpczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TAMAGO , a Japanese word, translates to an egg. We named it as such because just like the egg is the simplest form of life, this mini Kettle aptly reflects our ethos of simplicity. AESTHETICISM Being a unique combination of wood and stainless steel, it is natural, beautiful and durable. It is aesthetic enough to form a perfect oval while emitting a timeless and classic vibe. DURABILITY Adequate stainless steel support to the wood lends durability to the pour over coffee kettle and ensures that it would last longer as compared to other wooden kettles. It is also much less likely to lose shape due to high temperatures, and withstand wear and tear of daily usage. PERFECT TEMPERATURE CONTROL The wooden lid features a thermometer to gauge the temperature of the brew, which in turn is an outcome of maintaining the perfect taste for your personal like. COMFORTABLE FLOW-RATE Its 4mm gooseneck spout facilitates all types of pouring, namely controlled, heavy or dripping. Dual Indicators On the inner surface of the kettle, there is vertical marking with dual indications at levels 250 ml and 350 ml respectively. Wooden Pad at The Base No matter what the temperature of the water in the kettle might be, the base remains cool. Thus, the kettle can be placed on any surface without the fear of leaving imprints. Ergonomic, aesthetic, convenient and innovative . Use TAMAGO kettle to brew just the right amount of pour over coffee for yourself and experience the real sensation of warmth spread over your physical and emotional being. About Simple Real \"Simple Life, Real Sensation\" implies that to be simple is to be real.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iHWinpczL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SimpleReal","source_asin":"B07NL7LLBK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NL7LLBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NL7LLBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
