window.products.push({"id":74184,"name":"Kismile Countertop Ice Maker Machine, 44Lbs/24H Self-Cleaning Ice Makers, 24 pcs Square Ice Cube in 12 Mins, Portable Compact Ice Cube Maker, with Ice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RI2ZIy-JL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH-EFFICIENCY ICE MAKING: This countertop ice maker produces 24 pcs of ice cube every 12 mins and up to 44lbs in 24 hours. Stores as much as 2.7 pounds of ice at a time. The portable ice maker measures 10*14*14.6inches. The compact size makes it very easy to carry. With this ice maker machine, you'll never have to run to the store to buy bags of ice again. TWO WAYS TO ADD WATER: Simply open the dust-proof on top of the ice maker and add water manually or place a bottled water (not included) on the supporting seat to automatically fill the 3.2L water tank. Made of stainless steel, this machine is durable enough to hold bottled water up to 5L.When the water runs out, the ice machine will automatically display a water shortage reminder. AUTO SELF-CLEANING: With Auto self-cleaning function, this ice maker countertop takes the hassle out of cleaning. Long press the \"Timer\" button for more than 5s to enter the 20-minute self-cleaning. In addition, there is a drain hole to help drain meltwater quickly. So you can enjoy clean, healthy ice cube all the time. SIMPLE LCD CONTROL PANEL: The ice maker machine is equipped with a smart LCD panel. Any function can be solved in the easy-to-read control panel: 1-24H timing, ice full reminder, water shortage reminder, self-cleaning. By setting the timer, you can increase and reduce the ice-making time to adjust the thickness of the ice cube. CRYSTAL-CLEAR SQUARE ICE CUBE: Nobody can stand a scorching summer without ice. Keeping food fresh, making cold drinks, chilling beers, and champagne, it all comes true with an ice cube maker. Besides, clear square ice cubes are featured with slow-melting, fine in shape, and pure in clarity and density. Ideal choice for Home/Kitchen/Office/Bar/Party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RI2ZIy-JL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kismile","source_asin":"B09VRSZCPF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VRSZCPF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VRSZCPF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
