window.products.push({"id":74249,"name":"DG64-00473A Stove Knob Replacement Samsung, Gas Stove Replacement Knobs, Compatible with Samsung Range Oven Gas Stove Knob NX58F5700WS NX58H5600SS NX5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HnGgu43iS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"<p>【A Perfect Stove Knobs Replacement Samsung】The difference between these replacement oven knobs and the original is the replacements stove knob are shiny and D shaft upgraded with stainless steel material, the original stove knobs have a dull look and D shaft is made of plastic. While this is not a genuine Samsung part, A perfect replacement and it will  fit and work like the factory part.</p> <p>【Upgraded & Durable】This oven knobs replacements replaces the previous version, quality materials used, 100% tested before shipping. The installation hole diameter (D shaft size) is 0.27 inch/ 0.77 cm in length,  (please refer to picture 3) strong rings to reinforce around the middle part of the stove knobs - kinda like a tight sleeve around them to ensure they can take heavy duty and won't be cracked easily.</p> <p>【Replaces Part Number And Appliance Model】Cooktop knob replacement replaces part number: DG64-00473A, DG64-00473B, 3447565, AP5917439, PS9606608, B01GV9ZRM4, EAP9606608. Fit for Samsung Range Oven NX58H5600SS, NX58H5650WS, NX58J7750SS, NX58M6850SS, NX58K7850SS Gas Range - If your stove is black, you will need DG64-00473B instead and this knob won't match your color.</p> <p>【Low Replacement Cost 】That cooktop knob replacement matches the original, exceed original quality at half the price.The inside sleeve at the back of of the knob, the part that slips over the burner control rod on the range, is made of highly durable stainless steel material rigorously tested, compact & sturdy, longevous. Non OEM parts but meets OEM manufacturing requirements. Easy to install, saves time and money. Exactly the same size fit as the originals.</p> <p>【Attach Kitchen Silicone Stove Counter Gap Cover】-Made of 100% food grade heat resistant silicone,Sits perfectly in place, the flexible silicone gap cover conforms to stove and counter surfaces (even if they are uneven) and may be easily cut to fit non-standard sizes.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HnGgu43iS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aozzy","source_asin":"B09538C8QQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09538C8QQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09538C8QQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":74250,"name":"Ice Maker Machine Countertop, 3 in 1 Portable Ice Maker with Hot/Cold Water Dispenser, 12 Cubes in 7 Mins Stainless Steel Nugget Ice Maker, 44Lbs in 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C3kUyzKCL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional Nugget Ice Maker Countertop - FOOING countertop ice maker machine combine with water dispenser, truly getting ices cubes and cold water within the same machine, meet your different drinking needs. Three types, including ice cube, cold water and hot water, you won’t worry you can't enjoy cold drinks/teas/chilling beers/champagne etc in summer. Quick Continuous Ice Making - this portable ice maker countertop is equipped with a high-efficient but quiet compressor, only 7 minutes to get 12 chewable bullet-shaped ice cubes per cycle, meet the needs of ice. Besides, this crushed ice maker countertop can produce 144lbs ice in 24 hours, stores as much as 1.8 pounds of delicious ice cubes at a time, let you enjoy fresh chilled wine, whisky, beer, juice, soda all day long. Continuous supply - This counter top ice maker comes with 3L water tank, can using 2,3& 5 gallon water jugs loading from the top to have continues water supply or do it manually, minimizing how often you need to refill it. Build-in basket, can hold 2.6lbs ice , enough to keep drinks cold all day long. Smart Counter Ice Maker - The pellet ice maker holds LCD display and design with touch buttons, making portable ice maker easier to use. By touch the button, you can get ice cubes, cold water or hot water. And the indicators light clearly indicates when it needs more water or when the ice bucket is full. The countertop nugget ice maker has a water tanks below the ice basket, the melted ice can be recycled and reused for next cycle of ice making, no need to drain it. Ideal for Home/ Office Use - Size of tabletop ice maker is 16.9 x 10.9 x 18.8 inches, convenient and compact, this chewable ice maker will look good on a countertop while producing ice for whenever or wherever you need it. 45db sound level, FOOING counter nugget ice maker ensures a quiet environment, ideal for your living room, bedroom, office, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C3kUyzKCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOOING","source_asin":"B09QKTK7C9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QKTK7C9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QKTK7C9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":74251,"name":"wirsh Ice Maker- Countertop Ice Machine with Two Ice Cube Sizes, Countertop Ice Maker with LED Lights, Make 26lbs Ice in 24 Hours, 9 Cubes Ready in 7 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j+hkQbo9S._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Most Compact Ice Machine: With a size of 8.1x 12.0 x 11.5 inch, this countertop ice machine is compact enough for most countertops and easy to carry with, which can work anywhere there is a standard electrical outlet to plug it in. It is very useful for picnics, camping, and outdoor parties. Perfect for the boat, small kitchen, restrooms, bars, office, and more. Also, this Portable Ice Machine is designed in a sleek black coated finish to go with virtually any kitchen or breakroom style. Two sizes ice selectable & Self Cleaning :The Wirsh countertop Ice Maker comes with two ice bullets size selectable: Small and Large which is great for cold drinks or cooling foods. Furthermore, You Don’t need worry about the cleaning after you use it. Just hold the POWER button for 3 seconds the ice maker machine will automatically clean the interior. When self-cleaning is complete, the device will automatically switches to standby mode. Efficient Ice Maker – Although it's a portable ice machine, it has a high-capacity ice tank which is combined of ice scoop and removable ice basket. Once the machine is plugged in, it will begin to reduce temperature to make ice. You will be amazed at its fast speed. Moreover, the Wirsh Countertop Ice maker is equipped with a high efficiency compressor that requires low energy to keep the ice cool, save your time, energy and money. Rapid Ice Making: The Wirsh ice maker can produce 9 ice cubes in as little as 7 minutes, so you don’t have to wait for a long time before you can put the ice cubes into drinks. Keep the 1.6-quart water tank filled and this unit can even make up to 26 lbs. of bullet-shaped ice cubes in a 24 hour period - enough to keep drinks cold all day long. Simple and Safe: Our ice maker is simple to use with simple control panel, LED lights and full large clear viewing window. The button on the electronic control panel lets you turn it on /off and select the size of ice cube; the indicator lights up when the ice basket is full or you need to add more water. This ice cube maker is made from food safety grade materials, which can offer healthy ice cubes for you, ensuring the safety of drinking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j+hkQbo9S._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wirsh","source_asin":"B08ZHYQ175","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZHYQ175","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZHYQ175","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
