window.products.push({"id":74366,"name":"ABS Duct Connector for Exhaust 3 Way Duct Connector Duct Splitter Fan Dryer Vent Hose 6 Inch Y Shape for 6 Inch Hose with 3 PCS Hose Clamps (6 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qs5UKQi-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Duct Connector Material: Made of high quality ABS plastic, high strength, good toughness and easy processing. Duct Clamp Material: Made of high quality 304 stainless steel material,durable and sturdy. Connector Size:3 Way Connector has a diameter of 146mm (5.8 inch) per interface, suitable for hoses of 150 mm (6 Inch). Duct Clamps Size: Thickness: 0.023\"/0.6mm,width: 0.47\"/12mm,adjustable size range from 3.58\"-4.49\"/91mm-114mm. Product features: three-hole duct connector is smooth, and its reasonable curvature greatly reduces the wind resistance.This allows for smooth ventilation of the ventilation system.Duct Clamps make installation easier and faster, and the joints are seamless to achieve a good leak-proof effect. How to use:wipe the tee first, then dock it to the hose and fix it with aluminum foil tape. Finally, use clamps to fasten the secondary fixing. Package included : 1Pack Y shape duct connector +3Pack 6\" Duct Clamp","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qs5UKQi-L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enenes","source_asin":"B09PH8F9V2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PH8F9V2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PH8F9V2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":74367,"name":"20oz / 600ml Espriazza Professional Frothing Pitcher, Milk Frother Cup, with Heat Resistant Silicone Grip Pads, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rg813Ky0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bell-shaped, stainless steel & handle free, this frothing pitcher gives you extreme control with heat-resistant silicone grips. Plus, boost speed & cut waste with a narrow spout & built-in measuring. Want complete control of your latte art? Now you have it with the Espriazza Milk Frothing Pitcher. Unlike standard containers, your milk frother cup uses silicone pads for steadier, more precise pours. Adhered to the pitcher itself, the durable grips are heat-resistant & designed to fit comfortably in any size hand. For temperature regulation, your frothing jug has plenty of room for either fingertip testing or a thermometer clip. Increase Efficiency & Eliminate Overpouring Own a coffee shop? With built-in measurements, this steamed milk pitcher combines 2 must-have tools for accurate amounts every time. Achieve high-quality, reproducible results across your staff. No more dirtying up extra dishes and squandering expensive milk. Designed for New Hires & Seasoned Pros Ordinary, straight-walled pitchers can be hard to use for beginner baristas. That’s why your metal frothing cup offers a unique, bell-shaped design. Achieving a vortex and ultra-smooth microfoam is easier than ever. Plus, it’s dishwasher safe for quick cleaning. Other features include: 9.3 cm x 7.9 cm x 11 cm Holds 20 ounces (600 ml) Quality 18/8 stainless steel (304) 0.7mm thick Ultra-narrow, fluted spout Sleek, brushed finish Order Now Makes a great gift for coffee lovers, so pick up one for yourself and a friend today and enjoy the Espriazza difference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rg813Ky0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Espriazza","source_asin":"B01NCUYAN4","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCUYAN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NCUYAN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
