window.products.push({"id":74403,"name":"Refrigerator Drip Tray,Cuttable Fast Absorbent Drip Tray, Refrigerator Drip Catcher Hide Stain,Mini Fridge Drip Tray For Refrigerator Water Dispenser,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlIo6BtjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Super Absorption】This refrigerator drip tray have super absorbent soft diatomite that can suck up spilled water or coffee instantly. Mini fridge drip tray strong water absorption, durable and reusable.Make you no need to wipe the sink fridge tray every time after using cuttable refrigerator drip catcher. 【Hide Stains】The drip pad made of special PU leather surfaces hide coffee stains, water residue,milk stains, and any other dark messy stains. refrigerator drip catcher no need to clean frequently because hide stains well. Always keep the water catcher clean and tidy,avoid the trouble of cleaning the fidge drip trays. 【Anti-slip】The rubber backing bottom of the refrigerator drip mat for countertops has a good anti-slip effect. It's non-slip, waterproof and heat-proof. the anti-slip bottom will be absorbed on the water catcher to prevent it from moving when you open the refrigerator. The waterproof bottom can prevent spilled liquid from damaging the clean look to your refrigerator. 【Cut to Fit】 Fits Most Fridge Drip Trays - Between the Semi-circular and Rectangular design, the Drip Pad is sized to fit a wide variety of drip trays.If the size is unsuitable,cut the drip catcher tray to fit your refrigerator.If it cannot cover your long length of drip tray adequately, you can trim each drip guard with scissors and then piece them together. 【Easy Clean】Drip catcher no need to clean frequently because hide stains well. Only wash it every two weeks or long time. This refrigerator accessories will not fade or wrinkle. Drip tray for mini fridge can be washed by hand, dry naturally.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LlIo6BtjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maerolre","source_asin":"B0BTMMP926","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74403","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTMMP926","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTMMP926","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
