window.products.push({"id":74581,"name":"Full-Automatic Washing Machine Nictemaw Portable Washer 1.71 Cu.ft/15.6Lbs Capacity Laundry Washer Spin Dryer, 10 programs Selections with LED Display","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vDqr-pRtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Compact Design with Large Load Capacity】: This portable washing machine is compact in design for saving your space, what’s more its lightweight makes it very easily to move from one place to another. However the honeycomb shaped inner tub can load about 15.7lbs at one time and wash a lot of clothes for you. In user manual, we also listed reference weight of various clothes. 【Easy to Operate & Monitor】: This portable washer has 10 programs and 8 water level selections with LED display. All functions and operation including water level/spin, program/delay, time set and child lock are listed clearly. Operation Steps: 1) Connect the water inlet pipe to the faucet and turn on the tap;2) Power On the washer; 3) Select a program as you need; 4) Press Start button. Clear and transparent lid allows you to see and monitor the water and washing condition clearly. 【Precise Time & Water Level Control】: This washing machine owns very precise time and water control function through it’s smart control panel. It has 24 hours smart delay function. You can set the desired start time of washing in advance as your need. In addition, this washer has a child lock function. Once child lock function is set, all buttons will be locked which makes very safely for your family! 【Automatic Imbalance Adjustment】 : The laundry washer equipped with Auto Unbalance Detection (AUD). It's able to automatically fix the unbalance issue. If the laundries inside the tub are not put equally, it would cause violent vibration. At this time, our washing machine’s imbalance adjustment function will start automatically to adjust the imbalance situation if vibration is beyond certain level. 【US Stock and Sincere Services】: This washer Built to North American Electrical Standards and US stock makes delivery very quickly. We provide two years’ warranty, satisfactory or 100% money back in 30 days. Therefore please get it with mind free. Welcome to contact our customer service email if any problems at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vDqr-pRtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nictemaw","source_asin":"B08X4JT394","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X4JT394","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X4JT394","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
