window.products.push({"id":74615,"name":"Commercial Ice Maker Machine, 70 LBS/24H Under Counter Large Ice Machine w/ 10 LBS Capacity Ice Storage Bin, 2 Water Inlet Modes, Freestanding & Built","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":319.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717pL8R6orL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Super Efficient Ice Making Speed】- Powerful and professional, LifePlus commercial ice maker is specially designed for commercial and families that need a lot of ice use. It can make 70LBS of high-quality Ice cubes in 24H and 32 pieces of clear ice cubes per 11~20 mins. Equipped with a high-power compressor and 10LBS large ice storage bin. It will easily meet your daily and business needs. 【3 Ice Cube Thickness & 2 Water Inlet Modes】- Depending on the temperature, you can adjust the size of the ice cube through the simple control panel. There are 3 sizes of ice cubes available(S / M / L). And 2 water inlet modes allow you to connect tap water directly or use bucket water, it means you can move the ice maker anywhere to make ice. Simple, convenient and intelligent. 【Easy To Operate & Install】- Super user friendly! The simple control panel and simple installation method enable you to use it easily and successfully. 2 buttons and 5 indicators will clearly let you know how the ice maker works. As for installation, it only takes 3~5 steps to complete. The commercial ice maker will come with 1 drain hose, 1 ice shovel and 1 water inlet hose etc... No additional accessories are required to buy. So don't worry about spending too much time learning how to use it. 【10LBS Ice Bin & Excellent Insulation Lowers Melting Speed】- Considering that sometimes you don't need ice for the time being. We designed a 0.22 Cu.Ft large ice bin which can help you hold up to 10LBS of ice. And overflow protection will prevent it from making too much ice. At the same time, we introduce a thick insulation foam to this ice bin. It can effectively slow down the melting speed of ice to save your water and electricity. 【Auto Cleaning & Compact Size】- Long time use will leave some dirt inside the ice maker, and it is quite difficult to clean. So we designed an automatic cleaning function for it. Just press the power button for 5 seconds and then the cleaning will start. The compact size (14.09 x 13.78 x 24.8 In LxWxH) allows you to easily store it after summer without taking up too much space, or you can install it directly under the cabinet. Save time and effort. Trust me, it will change your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717pL8R6orL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B09RZMD4KD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RZMD4KD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RZMD4KD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
