window.products.push({"id":74618,"name":"Zulay Kitchen 12oz Stainless Steel Milk Frothing Pitcher - Milk Frother Cup - Easy-to-Clean Espresso Accessories - Easy-to-Read Creamer Measurements -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8110Spc-EQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get Creamy Frothy Milk In No Time: You can use it for frothing milk, measuring other liquids or for serving cream or other beverages to your guests. If you want that creamy latte, hot coco or cappuccino with the foam on top this is the lined milk jug for you. The ergonomic design makes it possible for anyone to use. Easy To Read Markings Inside Cup: Measurements inside the rim make it easy to measure liquids. The food grade metal Stainless Steel is also rust proof, so you can read the markings for years to come, guaranteed. The handle makes it easy to maneuver the pitcher around when frothing milk. Improve Your Barista Skills: Become a better coffee maker with the help of our handheld pitcher. Milk jug frother pitcher features a narrow spout that is perfect for pouring and for making cappucino art and latte art. Use it as a milk warmer for heated / steamed milk or as a serving pot for cold milk. A perfect alternative for those who can't stand the stovetop varieties! Easy To Clean & Dishwasher Friendly: Cleans in seconds! Just run it under hot water with a little soap or put it in the dishwasher. You will see it’s 100% clean. Consider buying multiple sets for friends, for travel and more! Whether you spell it capachino, capucinno or any other way, we know that our frothing cup will make it easier for you to create that delicious elixir! No Hassle, Zulay Guarantee: We are sure you will love your new milk frothing pitcher. If you’re not 100% satisfied don’t hesitate to contact us. As a small family owned business we care that every single one of our customers are happy and are always looking to do better. You have nothing to lose go ahead and get your milk frothing pitcher today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8110Spc-EQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zulay Kitchen","source_asin":"B07PFFBN8P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PFFBN8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PFFBN8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
