window.products.push({"id":74885,"name":"Stainless Steel Coffee Filter Dripper Scoop set Pour Over Reusable Titanium Coated BRONZE","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SGLzkwWRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What has ever happened to that tranquil moment of being able to brew a perfect cup of coffee within the peace of your own home? It seems that our hasty lives deprive us of being able to, even if for just a moment, forget about our everyday stresses and let us enjoy the simple things that used to matter. That’s why we introduce the Bronze Stainless Steel Reusable Titanium Coated Pour Over Coffee Filter Dripper Stand Scoop Set from JRK Designs!  Our coffee brewer / scoop set allows you to prepare your coffee just the way you like it without relying on those big-name expensive coffee shop brands. When, if ever, have you felt that the person behind the counter put that extra special personal touch to your beverage? All they do is make your coffee as quickly as they can, get your money, and then move onto the next customer (sad, but true). The coffee maker is for those of you who want to loose yourselves in the stress-free moment without the feeling of being just another person “next in line”. Enjoy your coffee the way you like it - it’s all about you. Simply place the filter over a mug, add a desired number of scoops, pour hot water, and then sip and enjoy – that’s all there is to it! Why not add this simple and stylish accessory to your kitchen right now? JRK Designs is here to provide you with the best service and, of course, a quality product for your hard-earned money. Needless to say, if our product is not what you’re looking for, we offer a 100% money back guarantee with no questions asked! Trust us, we know how to treat our customers, because we are customers, too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SGLzkwWRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JRK Designs","source_asin":"B01MXD7ABT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-74885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MXD7ABT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MXD7ABT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
